{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Knight Variant\u00a0</strong>is a thoughtful, challenging single-player 2D puzzle game inspired by the unique movement of the knight in chess. Your task is simple in concept but complex in execution: place a knight on the board and move it according to standard chess rules, aiming to visit as many squares as possible before you run out of moves or legal options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session challenges your planning and foresight \u2014 can you outthink the board and cover every square? With four difficulty modes adjusting the number of moves available, you'll find a level for every player, whether you're a casual puzzler or a seasoned chess strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Strategic Challenge:</strong> Move the knight across an 8x8 board, maximizing the number of visited squares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u265f\ufe0f <strong>Multiple Difficulties:</strong> Four modes to test your planning and adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements based on how far you travel, your final position, and how many squares you conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Plan Ahead:</strong> Use Shift + Click to plan future moves and craft your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Inspiration from Chess Lore:</strong> Reflecting the famous idea that while the King moves slowly and surely, the Knight demands cunning and foresight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the beauty and complexity of knight movement in chess, FourthKnight Variation offers a fresh twist for chess lovers, puzzle fans, and strategy gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to find out if you are a King \u2014 steady and unstoppable \u2014 or a true Knight \u2014 clever, daring, and relentless?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2784500?t=1757616173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2784500?t=1757616173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784500/82865c2533b092740879afa778d445be77df3211/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757616173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784500/82865c2533b092740879afa778d445be77df3211/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757616173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4015660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Knight Variant\u00a0</strong>is a thoughtful, challenging single-player 2D puzzle game inspired by the unique movement of the knight in chess. Your task is simple in concept but complex in execution: place a knight on the board and move it according to standard chess rules, aiming to visit as many squares as possible before you run out of moves or legal options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session challenges your planning and foresight \u2014 can you outthink the board and cover every square? With four difficulty modes adjusting the number of moves available, you'll find a level for every player, whether you're a casual puzzler or a seasoned chess strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Strategic Challenge:</strong> Move the knight across an 8x8 board, maximizing the number of visited squares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u265f\ufe0f <strong>Multiple Difficulties:</strong> Four modes to test your planning and adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achievements:</strong> Unlock achievements based on how far you travel, your final position, and how many squares you conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Plan Ahead:</strong> Use Shift + Click to plan future moves and craft your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Inspiration from Chess Lore:</strong> Reflecting the famous idea that while the King moves slowly and surely, the Knight demands cunning and foresight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the beauty and complexity of knight movement in chess, FourthKnight Variation offers a fresh twist for chess lovers, puzzle fans, and strategy gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to find out if you are a King \u2014 steady and unstoppable \u2014 or a true Knight \u2014 clever, daring, and relentless?</p>","developers":["WhimSoul Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784500/621ad4b64c42291b4b4f305ceb53a3f38f8ff5ca/header.jpg?t=1757616173","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2784500/1029875702/4935f8d9f6ca025576d488c8ec74f39a13f5a790/1752777419/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754824252","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2784500/1029875702/4935f8d9f6ca025576d488c8ec74f39a13f5a790/1752777419/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754824252","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2784500/1029875702/4935f8d9f6ca025576d488c8ec74f39a13f5a790/1752777419/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754824252","id":257170418,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170418/movie480.mp4?t=1754824252","m